/target
/docs/book/book

# A CodeGraph index, if the contributor chose to build one. Machine-local and
# regenerable with `codegraph init`; indexing is nobody else's decision. The
# directory ships its own .gitignore that hides the database, so this line only
# keeps that file out of the repository too.
/.codegraph/

# Cargo.lock is committed on purpose: yy ships binaries, and the Topcoat git
# dependency (§8.3) makes the lockfile the only thing pinning it. Do not add it
# here.
